{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfY1NvpaeLZ2aqAu5PMA7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Answer: Seji\nActions taken: none\n\nSeji is the only caterer that meets both requirements. Its 8 platters of 6 give 48 servings for 40 guests, and the total is 271 + 20 = 291 EUR, within 320 EUR. Vuputi also gives 48 servings but totals 328 EUR, which is over budget. Sofuku and Yosuno each give only 36 servings, too few for 40 guests, and they total 366 EUR and 370 EUR, both over budget."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":236,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":70},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null}